{"path":"/tip/21-12","title":"出国带药先查目的地规定：含伪麻黄碱、可待因的感冒药和止咳药，安眠药、精神类药和强效止痛药，带原包装、处方或医生证明，只带自用量 | HowToLiveBetter","description":"伪麻黄碱超过 10%、可待因超过 1% 的感冒药和止咳药，在日本按兴奋剂原料或麻醉药品管，要提前申请许可。安眠药带超过一个月的量，日本也要事先办证，新加坡带管制成分的药要提前申请。带原包装和医生证明、只带自用量，才能避开药被没收、罚款甚至判刑。","lang":"zh","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter 首页","href":"/"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["阅读全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["精选 50 条"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["每日任务"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["我的清单"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["更多"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-tools"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-sound-toggle","aria-label":"关闭音效","aria-pressed":"true","title":"关闭音效"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-theme-trigger","aria-label":"跟随系统","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-sun life-theme-icon-light","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 20v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{