":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。出发前查一次目的地官网，几分钟。要带管制药的，还得多跑一趟医院开证明，并提前两周左右申请。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["日本把药按成分分几类管。含伪麻黄碱超过 10% 的药，算「兴奋剂原料」。含可待因超过 1% 的，算麻醉药品。这两类要在入境前向厚生劳动省的麻药取缔部申请许可，至少提前 14 天。药必须本人随身带，不能邮寄，也不能让家人代带。地西泮、三唑仑这类精神类药，带一个月用量以内不用申请。普通药也有限量：处方药…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：出国带药先查目的地规定：含伪麻黄碱、可待因的感冒药和止咳药，安眠药、精神类药和强效止痛药，带原包装、处方或医生证明，只带自用量"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。出发前查一次目的地官网，几分钟。要带管制药的，还得多跑一趟医院开证明，并提前两周左右申请。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["日本把药按成分分几类管。含伪麻黄碱超过 10% 的药，算「兴奋剂原料」。含可待因超过 1% 的，算麻醉药品。这两类要在入境前向厚生劳动省的麻药取缔部申请许可，至少提前 14 天。药必须本人随身带，不能邮寄，也不能让家人代带。地西泮、三唑仑这类精神类药，带一个月用量以内不用申请。普通药也有限量：处方药一个月用量以内，其他药两个月用量以内。超出就要先办「输入确认证」。中国驻日本大使馆的提醒原文是：违法违规携带药品等入境日本，「违者将被罚款、拘留甚至判刑，违禁品将被没收」。新加坡卫生科学局（HSA）的规定是：不含管制成分的药，最多带 3 个月用量。要随身带处方或医生信的复印件。药要放在原包装里，贴着药房的标签。含管制成分的药，至少提前 2 周申请批准。超过 3 个月用量的一律不许带入，口香糖形式的药也不行。替别人带药，只限直系亲属自己的处方药。不合规的药会被没收，还可能被执法。中国这头，海关法要求个人携带进出境的物品「以自用、合理数量为限」。麻醉药品和第一类精神药品，凭医院的诊断书和身份证明，可以带单张处方最大用量以内。海关按自用、合理的原则放行"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["日本厚生劳动省麻药取缔部. Application Guidance（携带含管制成分的药品出入境）：「When you enter/leave Japan carrying your medicine containing controlled substances in Japan for your own medical use, you need to get a permission in advance.」「You should apply at least 14 days prior to your travel.」「you can't send your medicine to/from Japan and you can't also entrust carrying it to other people, such as your family.」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ncd.mhlw.go.jp/en/application2.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ncd.mhlw.go.jp/en/application2.html"]},"；日本厚生劳动省麻药取缔部 (2024). Controlled Substances List（2024 年 12 月 12 日版）：「Ephedrine, Pseudoephedrine (*Any substances containing 10% or less of ephedrine or pseudoephedrine are excluded.)」「Codeine … (*Any substances containing 1% or less of codeine or its salt are excluded.)」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ncd.mhlw.go.jp/dl_data/keitai/cotrolled_substances_list20241212%20.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ncd.mhlw.go.jp/dl_data/keitai/cotrolled_substances_list20241212%20.pdf"]},"；日本厚生劳动省. Information for those who are bringing medicines for personal use into Japan：「Poison, Deadly poison, Prescription drug : Up to 1 month supply」「Other Drugs, Quasi drugs : Up to 2 month supply」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/stf/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iyakuhin/kojinyunyu/topics/tp010401-1_00001.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.mhlw.go.jp/stf/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iyakuhin/kojinyunyu/topics/tp010401-1_00001.html"]},"；日本厚生劳动省. 医薬品等の個人輸入について：「医療用向精神薬(ジアゼパム、トリアゾラム等)の携帯輸入: 1ヶ月分を超える分量又は注射剤を携帯輸入する場合は、事前に輸入確認証を取得する必要があります」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/stf/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iyakuhin/kojinyunyu/topics/tp010401-1.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.mhlw.go.jp/stf/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iyakuhin/kojinyunyu/topics/tp010401-1.html"]},"；中国驻日本大使馆 (2018). 来日本旅行请勿携带违禁品. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://jp.china-embassy.gov.cn/jbwzlmnew/lszcnew/LSBHYXZ/LSBHLBZN/201811/t20181113_9475556.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://jp.china-embassy.gov.cn/jbwzlmnew/lszcnew/LSBHYXZ/LSBHLBZN/201811/t20181113_9475556.htm"]},"；Health Sciences Authority, Singapore. Bringing in personal medications：「You may bring up to 3 months' supply if no approval is needed and the medication is not prohibited.」「Please note that imports of quantities exceeding 3 months' supply are not allowed.」「Failure to comply will result in your medication being confiscated or enforcement action may be taken.」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.hsa.gov.sg/travelling-with-medication-and-medical-devices/personal-medications/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.hsa.gov.sg/travelling-with-medication-and-medical-devices/personal-medications/"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2021 年修正). 海关法（第四十六条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817ab22b8a017abd719e0f05c0","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817ab22b8a017abd719e0f05c0"]},"；国务院 (2024 年第三次修订). 麻醉药品和精神药品管理条例（第四十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081819c230ff2019c2d0fcaed641d","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081819c230ff2019c2d0fcaed641d"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["规定会变，各国也不一样，本书只写查法。出发前看目的地卫生部门或海关的官网，或者中国驻当地使馆的领事提醒。上面日本、新加坡的规定，按 2026 年 10 月 14 日的官网核对。药里有没有这些成分，看说明书上的成分表，拿不准就问开药的医生。带药的最好是吃药的人自己，新加坡只许替直系亲属带他们自己的处方药。这和第 8 节第 29 条（不帮陌生人带东西）是一个道理。处方和药盒拍照存一份，存法见本节第 7 条（拍照存一份在云端）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/21-11"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"出境前把行程、住处和同行人发给一位家人，约好多久联系一次"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/21-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"从国外回国入境时别带肉制品（真空包装的火腿、肉干也算）、奶酪、新鲜水果和种子，带了动植物产品就走红色通道申报"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/21-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["知道领事保护能做什么、不能做什么：能探视，不能捞人，费用还得自己付"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["你在国外被抓，使领馆能做的是：向当地核实情况、要求依法公正处理、去看你、开庭时旁听。它不能替你改判，也不能把人领走。别人先垫的食宿、交通、医疗费，最后还是你自己…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/21-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["买一份含境外医疗和医疗转运的保险，别只买航班延误险"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["在国外看病的钱要自己掏。国内医保基本不报，使领馆也不垫。真正能拖垮一个家的不是门诊费，是重伤以后的住院，还有把人运回国，那得靠专机或者医疗护送。买旅行险主要看两…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/21-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["「境外高薪招聘」一律当诈骗看，被骗去做电诈回来还可能要被限制出境"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["月薪高得离谱、不问学历经验、不签正规合同、让你先到边境城市集合、还替你保管护照。这种活去了，人和护照都不在自己手上。出境时材料造假，边检会把你拦下不放行。在境外…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/21-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["境外取现一年不能超过 10 万元人民币，是本人名下所有卡合起来算的；随身带现金出入境，人民币每次最多 2 万元，外币超过 5000 美元要向海关申报"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["境外取现按你名下所有银行卡合起来算，每年 10 万元人民币封顶，超过了当年和第二年都不能再取。刷卡消费不受影响。随身带现金出入境，人民币每次最多 2 万元，外币…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/21-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["护照、签证、身份证都拍照存一份在云端，丢了先报警再补旅行证"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["护照丢了，使领馆能给你补一张回国用的旅行证件，但你要能证明自己是谁。手里有资料页、签证页的照片和出入境记录，补办就快得多。你还得先在当地报警拿到回执，很多国家出…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/21-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["境外自驾先确认当地认不认中国驾照，网上卖的「国际驾照」多数是废纸"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["网上代办的「国际驾照」在中国内地不成立。那本证是 1949 年日内瓦公约缔约方之间互认的翻译件，103 个缔约方里没有中国内地。所以国内不管谁给你办，都没有法律…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/21"},"children":["阅读整个主题：出国、旅行与境外安全 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"childr